"""Timing of assemble_context with synthetic long correction chains / stars (tiny_bundle base)."""
import sys, time, cProfile, pstats, io
from datetime import datetime, timedelta, timezone
from vcommon import *
import services.learning.context as C

def ts(i):
    return (datetime(2025, 2, 1, tzinfo=timezone.utc) + timedelta(seconds=i)).strftime("%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ")

def make(shape, chains, length):
    s, f, e, a = tiny_bundle()
    base = next(x for x in e if x["event_id"] == "e-02-u")
    seq = 1000
    for c in range(chains):
        for i in range(length):
            seq += 1
            if shape == "chain":
                corr = None if i == 0 else f"c{c}-{i-1}"
            else:  # star: every event corrects the root
                corr = None if i == 0 else f"c{c}-0"
            e.append({**base, "event_id": f"c{c}-{i}", "device_sequence": seq, "captured_at": ts(seq),
                      "text": f"basis arrow chain {c} step {i}", "correction_of": corr,
                      "frame_id": None, "media_position": None, "gap_flags": ["missing_frame"]})
    ar = FixtureArchive(s, f, e, a)
    return ar, RetrievalIndex(ar)

for shape, chains, length, mode, M in [(a, int(b), int(c), d, int(m)) for a, b, c, d, m in (x.split(":") for x in sys.argv[1:])]:
    ar, ix = make(shape, chains, length)
    counter = {"n": 0}
    orig = C.canonical
    t = time.perf_counter()
    p = assemble_context(ar, ix, {"text": "basis arrow", "mode": mode}, user_id=USER, top_k=100, max_bytes=M)
    dt = time.perf_counter() - t
    print(f"{shape} chains={chains} len={length} events={len(ar.events)} mode={mode} max_bytes={M}: {dt:.2f}s "
          f"eligible={p['budget']['eligible_item_count']} included={p['budget']['included_item_count']} hits={p['retrieval']['returned_hit_count']} "
          f"packet={len(canonical(p))}B", flush=True)
EOF
